* An iteration ` i < R ` of the scan loop without success at ` k + i ` : the success flag is off at ` i + 1 ` (a success at ` i + 1 = R ` would be one at ` k + i ` , ~ tmscsome ), and ` i + 1 = R ` exactly when the fuel ` fuel - ( i + 1 ) ` is spent.

